flowchart TB
  accTitle: Application replies
  accDescr: A local model extracts a reply type and quote. The tracker checks the quote against the message and identifies the specific role. Clear decisions are journalled in SQLite. Conflicting evidence goes to review.
  pages["Read collected email pages"] --> registry["Match employer and open roles"]
  registry --> quote["Extract reply type and quote locally"]
  quote --> proof{"Quote in current<br/>mail, role verified?"}
  proof -.->|Unclear| review["Queue for human review"]
  proof -->|Verified| write["Record decision in SQLite"]
  write --> views["Refresh application tracker"]
